00:57:43.060 --> 00:57:50.970
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who will tell you that when he and I went out just last week for that drink, he'll say it was not a date.
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚负责，他会告诉你，上周我和他出去喝酒时，那不是约会。

00:57:50.970 --> 00:57:58.680
<v Tina>I didn't think of it that way at all. It was just a really special friendship and bond that I had with him.
<v Tina>我根本没往那个方向想。那只是我和他之间非常特别的友谊和纽带。

00:57:58.680 --> 00:58:55.150
